<style>
      :root {
        --font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      }

  /* General Styles */
  body {
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    color: #333;
    margin: 0;
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    line-height: 1.8;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  
  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Main Content - Clean, centered, no backgrounds */
  main {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px 20px 20px;
    background: transparent;
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  
  /* Headings */
  h1 {
    text-align: center;
    color: #01535b;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .accent-bar {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 32px auto;
    width: 80px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00bfae 0%, #01535b 100%);
  }

  h2 {
    color: #01535b;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 35px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-left: 6px solid #00bfae;
    padding-left: 12px;
  }
  
  /* Paragraph Styling */
  p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /* List Styling */
  ul {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  ul li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 32px;
  }
  
  ul li:before {
    content: '\2714';
    color: #00bfae;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 2px;
  }
  
  /* Call-to-action box */
  .cta-box {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00bfae 0%, #01535b 100%);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 28px 20px;
    margin: 38px 0 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px 0 rgba(1,83,91,0.15);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  
  .cta-box strong {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  
  /* Links */
  a {
    color: #01535b;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
    }
    
    h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    main {
      padding: 30px 15px 15px 15px;
    }
  
    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
  
    p, ul {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    main {
      padding: 20px 12px 12px 12px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    p, ul {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    
    .cta-box {
      padding: 20px 15px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    
    .cta-box strong {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
  </style>
  
  <main>
    <h1>About Managira</h1>
    <span class="accent-bar"></span>
    <p>Welcome to Managira — the next-generation school management platform designed to revolutionize educational administration. Managira is a product of scREAte Ltd., created with one goal in mind: to help schools work smarter, not harder. From student enrollment to academic tracking and beyond, our all-in-one SaaS solution empowers educational institutions to streamline operations, enhance communication, and focus on what truly matters — delivering exceptional education.</p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>At Managira, we believe technology should simplify the educational experience, not complicate it. Our mission is to provide schools, colleges, and training institutions with a single, powerful platform that removes administrative burdens, cuts down paperwork, and connects students, teachers, parents, and administrators in one smooth workflow.</p>

    <h2>What Makes Managira Different</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Comprehensive School Management</strong> – We go beyond basic student information systems, offering tools that handle everything from enrollment and attendance tracking to academic reporting and fee management.</li>
      <li><strong>Real-Time Data & Insights</strong> – Our analytics dashboard gives you the power to monitor performance, track trends, and make informed decisions — instantly.</li>
      <li><strong>Designed for Mobility</strong> – Whether on desktop, tablet, or phone, you can access your school’s data anytime, anywhere.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Core Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Student Information Management</strong> – Complete student profiles with academic history, personal details, and guardian information.</li>
      <li><strong>Enrollment & Admissions</strong> – Streamlined application processing with automated workflows and easy document management.</li>
      <li><strong>Attendance Tracking</strong> – Real-time attendance monitoring for accurate and reliable record-keeping.</li>
      <li><strong>Grade & Assessment Management</strong> – Digital gradebooks, assignment tracking, and performance analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Parent Portal & Public Website</strong> – Give parents a live view of school updates and their child’s progress through a dedicated portal, while your public-facing website helps the community learn more about your institution.</li>
      <li><strong>Report Generation</strong> – Create customized reports for academics, finances, and overall school operations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who We Serve</h2>
    <p>Managira is built for educational institutions of every size and type:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Primary & Secondary Schools</strong> – Complete K–12 management solutions.</li>
      <li><strong>Colleges & Universities</strong> – Advanced tools for higher education.</li>
      <li><strong>Educational Districts</strong> – Centralized systems for managing multiple institutions.</li>
      <li><strong>Private Schools</strong> – Tailored solutions for independent learning environments.</li>
      <li><strong>Training Centers</strong> – Specialized features for vocational and professional education.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why Choose Managira?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Proven Reliability</strong> – Built on secure, scalable technology with 99.9% uptime.</li>
      <li><strong>Quick Setup</strong> – Start fast with an intuitive interface and smooth onboarding.</li>
      <li><strong>Dedicated Support</strong> – Ongoing assistance, training, and platform improvements.</li>
      <li><strong>Cost-Effective</strong> – Reduce operational costs without sacrificing quality.</li>
      <li><strong>Scalable</strong> – From small schools to large districts, Managira grows with you.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <strong>Transform your school’s management today.</strong><br>
      Join the growing number of institutions that trust Managira to simplify operations and elevate the learning experience.<br><br>
      <span style="font-size:1.08rem;">📞 Contact us to schedule a demo, request more information, or start your free trial.</span>
    </div>
  </main>

